535
00:41:16,870 --> 00:41:19,132
[SPEAKER_01]: So, you can say no at any given time to anything.

536
00:41:19,952 --> 00:41:23,915
[SPEAKER_01]: And that's the nature of the aggregate of choice, the aggregate of intention.

537
00:41:25,135 --> 00:41:25,696
[SPEAKER_01]: You also...

