00:41:26,576 --> 00:41:28,998
[SPEAKER_01]: It has its own domain.

539
00:41:29,158 --> 00:41:33,781
[SPEAKER_01]: It's separable from one, inconceivable from other aggregates, but in itself, it's an independent thing.

540
00:41:34,101 --> 00:41:35,362
[SPEAKER_00]: Does intention suffer?

541
00:41:36,747 --> 00:41:36,927
[SPEAKER_01]: No.

542
00:41:37,107 --> 00:41:38,048
[SPEAKER_01]: Intention is intended.

