548
00:41:52,135 --> 00:41:52,995
[SPEAKER_00]: Feelings are suffering.

549
00:41:54,116 --> 00:41:54,536
[SPEAKER_01]: Every feeling.

550
00:41:54,556 --> 00:41:58,718
[SPEAKER_01]: The fact that you feel good or bad, pleasure or pain, or neutral, that's suffering.

551
