00:42:16,886 --> 00:42:18,027
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay, sure.

557
00:42:18,247 --> 00:42:25,194
[SPEAKER_01]: So, there is a degree of independence as a domain, perception and feeling and intention.

558
00:42:26,843 --> 00:42:28,884
