[SPEAKER_01]: Because then the pleasure that arises is the pleasure that's not unwholesome.

594
00:45:11,833 --> 00:45:27,599
[SPEAKER_01]: So, the desire for pleasure can be used to basically develop wisdom to recognize that, sure, I could go after immediate pleasure, or relatively immediate pleasure, but that won't bring any kind of

